  "priorExpiration": "2007-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.07 “Contadores Publicos Certificado” means a person holding a current accounting license issued in Mexico that is at a level equivalent to a CPA in the United States.\n\nSource. #6901, eff 12-4-98; ss by #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\nNew. #9032, eff 11-21-07; ss by #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.06); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.06)",
